  iconOne: {fileID: 73188984}
  iconTwo: {fileID: 529185317}
  descriptionOne: {fileID: 715839257}
  descriptionTwo: {fileID: 757848060}
  levelOnePowerupDescriptions:
  - Saves your progress and helps you continue.
  - Reduces the chance of getting a boss question by 5%.
  - Adds 50% of points when you get a correct answer.
  - Skips the question. You will not get any points.
  - Gives a hint to the answer that appears for 5 seconds.
  - Removes one of the choices in the question.
  - Adds 15 seconds to the timer.
